export anchor Psychedelic60sStyle:
    number: 63
    screen: Calendar
    name: Psychedelic 60s
    idea: A warm concert poster of a week, with swirling orange, magenta and yellow waves, bubble lettering and an op-art medallion, while the event cards stay plain and easy to read.
    base: light
    palette:
        peachPage: #fff1d6, the page
        cream: #fffaf0, day cards, boxes and pills
        plum: #3a1030, text, all outlines and the selected nav and view
        duskyPlum: #6e3a5a, times and meta
        magenta: #b0125b, the primary button and the today card shadow
        sunshine: #ffd23f, the poster base, the Team badge and the focus halo
        orange: #e8590c, bubble letter shadows, waves and medallion rings
        bubblegum: #ffd0e4, the today card
        tangerine: #ffd9b0, the current week row and the Deadline badge
        burntOrange: #a63600, Deadline text and dashed borders
        violet: #5b2a86, Out of office text and dotted borders
    type:
        Bubble display for headings and day numbers, Cooper Black, Cooper Std,
        Arial Rounded MT Bold, Bookman Old Style, URW Bookman, Georgia, serif,
        in plum with a 3px yellow then 6px orange offset text shadow. Body in
        Trebuchet MS, Segoe UI, Lucida Grande, Verdana, sans-serif. Sizes are
        64px bubble for the poster title, 44px bubble day numbers, 24px bubble
        box headings, 18px bold day names, 16px bold event titles, 16px body
        and 14px bold times.
    layout:
        A full width poster header on sunshine yellow with four stacked wavy
        bands in light orange, orange, pink and yellow, closed by a wavy plum
        edge. On it sit cream pill chips for the brand, the nav and Mara, the
        big bubble title, the dates in a pill and the controls. Below, a 320px
        left column holds a round op-art medallion of concentric orange,
        yellow and magenta rings with the month table on a cream disc, then a
        Tune in box with the checkboxes and a Far out box about Lena. The
        week is two staggered columns of day cards zigzagging down either side
        of a striped centre ribbon, each event on its own white rounded card
        with a round badge icon. Below 1060px the side column moves above in a
        row, and below 720px the days stack in one column beside a thin stripe.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px between cards, a 40px gutter around the centre stripe and 18 to 20px card padding.
    density: Loose and loud. Two staggered columns with roomy cards.
    corners: Big and lopsided. Day cards alternate 48px and 16px corners, events are 20px and controls are full pills.
    borders: Thick plum outlines, 3px on cards and controls and 2px on events. Deadline borders are dashed burnt orange, out of office dotted violet.
    shadows: Hard offsets only, 4px plum under the primary button and 6px magenta under the today card.
    icons:
        Chunky filled shapes in 30px round badges. A four petal flower marks
        Team, a lightning bolt marks Deadline and rainbow arcs mark Out of
        office, with the word shown for deadlines and absences. Today is a
        plum dot with a double ring.
    focus: A 4px plum outline offset 3px with a 10px sunshine halo.
    tone: Playful and warm, such as Groovy week ahead, Tune in, Far out and Free and easy.
